"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2880,"###
 Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashshar, who said: Narrated to us Muhammad bin Ja'far, who said: Narrated to us Shu'bah, from Al-Hakam; and also narrated to us Al-Za'farani, who said: Narrated to us Muhammad bin Abi 'Adi, from Shu'bah, from Al-Hakam and Mansur, from Ibrahim, from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Yazid, who said: ""I performed Hajj with 'Abdullah (bin Mas'ud"
